'''Obsolite''' is an {{Epic}} collection item. As an ore, it has the appearance of purple stained glass pane.

== Collection ==
Collecting {{Item|Youngite}}, {{Item|Timite}}, or '''Obsolite''' increases the player's [[Timite]] [[Collections|collection]], unlocking useful items and rewarding {{SkyBlock XP}} at specific milestones.

{{:Timite/Collection UI}}
{{CollectionTable|Timite}}

== Obtaining ==
'''Obsolite''' can be obtained by using a {{Item|Time Gun}} on {{Item|Timite}} for 2 seconds until it turns purple, then breaking it with a {{Item|Chrono Pickaxe}}. Only {{Green|1}} '''Obsolite''' will drop.

Attempting to use a {{Item|Time Gun}} on '''Obsolite''' results in the following message:
{{Dialogue|&9&lPARADOX! &cThis ore has maximum time wackification!}}

